<<
/Title (Project Beacon is a not-for-profit organisation based in Sydney whose goal is to bring the world of STEM directly into the hands of young student innovators. All our presenters are current university students pursuing STEM degrees, allowing them to provide an engaging and relatable learning experience for each student. Our interactive and curriculum-aligned workshops aim to teach students the fundamentals of robotics, from manufacturing through to programming and testing. Each workshop is built around students creating robots they can take home, inspiring continual experimentation and future learning.)
